Package: kestra
Title: Send Outputs, Metrics, Logs and Assets from R Scripts to 'Kestra'
Version: 0.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kestra Technologies", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Ludovic", "Dehon", email = "ldehon@kestra.io", role = "cre"))
Description: Helpers for R scripts run by 'Kestra' script tasks. Each send call
    prints one '::{...}::' line to stdout, which 'Kestra' reads as task
    outputs, metrics, logs or assets. Also reads the execution context.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://kestra.io, https://github.com/kestra-io/libs
BugReports: https://github.com/kestra-io/libs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
